# Mouse cradle for the count-rate runs (setups q35 and q86 of NECR_main_std.mac). It does not move in this test:
# all 10 parts are placed at (0, {cradleY}, 0), with cradleY from the SETUP block of NECR_main_std.mac.
# There is no mu-map of the mouse cradle. I derived it from the rat cradle (taken from the Quad86 mu-map) by
# scaling its cross-section by 0.487 (outer radius about 17 mm), with the axial dimensions unchanged. The real
# mouse cradle has solid side walls about 3 mm thick, so the notches of the outer surface are closed and the
# steep drop to the floor (below y = -8 mm in the cradle's own frame) is rounded so that the wall is at least
# 3 mm thick there; the largest radius is unchanged. The floor with its channels is that of the scaled cradle
# (floor top at y = -12.055 mm in the cradle's own frame). The STL files in stl_mbed3mm/ were made with a script
# that is not included.
# Material Bed_HDPE (polyethylene C2H4, 0.95 g/cm3, coil_bed_real/Coil3Bed.db), the same as the rat cradle: both
# real cradles are made of the same white, opaque plastic, which I modelled as polyethylene.
# With cradleY = -0.455 mm the centred phantom rests on the floor with a 0.01 mm gap, and the rounded walls stay
# at least 0.96 mm from the phantom and the tube ends.
# Cut at z = -80 ... +80 mm (beyond the detectors) to save time. The parts (mbed3mm_s00NN) are attached to the
# PhantomSD; necr_analysis.py counts scatter in them as 'object' scatter.

/gate/world/daughters/name mbed3mm_s0087
/gate/world/daughters/insert tessellated
/gate/mbed3mm_s0087/geometry/setPathToSTLFile coil_bed_real/stl_mbed3mm/mbed3mm_s0087.stl
/gate/mbed3mm_s0087/setMaterial Bed_HDPE
/gate/mbed3mm_s0087/placement/setTranslation 0 {cradleY} 0 mm
/gate/mbed3mm_s0087/vis/setColor white
/gate/mbed3mm_s0087/attachPhantomSD

/gate/world/daughters/name mbed3mm_s0088
/gate/world/daughters/insert tessellated
/gate/mbed3mm_s0088/geometry/setPathToSTLFile coil_bed_real/stl_mbed3mm/mbed3mm_s0088.stl
/gate/mbed3mm_s0088/setMaterial Bed_HDPE
/gate/mbed3mm_s0088/placement/setTranslation 0 {cradleY} 0 mm
/gate/mbed3mm_s0088/vis/setColor white
/gate/mbed3mm_s0088/attachPhantomSD

